# Deployment and Configuration Guide

## Environment Setup

- Node.js version is specified in [.nvmrc](mdc:.nvmrc)
- Package dependencies are managed through [package.json](mdc:package.json)
- Yarn is used as the package manager ([yarn.lock](mdc:yarn.lock))

## Build Configuration

- Next.js configuration is in [next.config.mjs](mdc:next.config.mjs)
- PostCSS configuration in [postcss.config.mjs](mdc:postcss.config.mjs)
- Cloudflare Workers configuration in [wrangler.toml](mdc:wrangler.toml)

## Deployment Process

1. The application uses Next.js with Edge Runtime capabilities
2. Deployment is handled through Cloudflare Workers
3. Build artifacts are generated in the `.next` directory
4. Wrangler is used for Cloudflare Workers deployment

## Monitoring Setup

Error tracking and monitoring is configured through:
- [sentry.edge.config.ts](mdc:sentry.edge.config.ts) for edge runtime
- [sentry.server.config.ts](mdc:sentry.server.config.ts) for server runtime

## Git Configuration

- Git ignore rules are specified in [.gitignore](mdc:.gitignore)
- Husky is used for Git hooks ([.husky](mdc:.husky))
